<title>USA: Brightpoint Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Brightpoint Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.29		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net			  3,209		    1,583</p>
<p> Revs		     145,290		  100,915</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,221		    8,961</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share pro forma.</p>
<p>All financial information for 1995 and 1996 reflect combined results of Brightpoint and Allied Communications Inc, which merged earlier this year.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.54		    $0.56</p>
<p> Net			  6,032		    4,938</p>
<p> Revs		     378,146		  290,017</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,169		    8,859</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 net income excluding effect of one-time merger expenses $8,093,000 or $0.72/share.</p>
